<tab><cl=F0F010>TOURNAMENTS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>The tournament is a great opportunity to test your strength in a duel with a worthy opponent.
To participate in the tournament, you need to submit an application for participation to the Organizer.
The organizers are standing next to the main cities of Hyperion next to the tournament teleport.
After registration, it remains to wait for the announcement of the start of the tournament, they will write about it in the chat.
All participants should move to the arena using the tournament teleport near the Organizer.

Please note that during the tournament, everyone who is waiting for their turn is not allowed to run into the arena or help other players.
The tournament can be of the following types:<br>
Duel: Players fight one-on-one<br>
The winner is the player who survived, or who has more health left.
If you run away from the arena, defeat is counted.<br>
Some mantras and skills that allow you to win instantly are prohibited in the tournament.
In addition, castle things can be put on, but they will not give an effect.<br><br>
King of the Mountain: Everyone is fighting each other<br><br>
The winner will receive the prize indicated on the registration window.<br><br>

<l="hts:\\language\tournament_gvg.hts">Group<\l>: Players are divided into two groups that fight each other.<br>
<br>
}